        {
          "book": "PRO",
          "chapter": 26,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "A whip is for the horse, a bridle for the donkey, and a rod for the back of fools!",
      "ko": "말에게는 채찍이요 나귀에게는 자갈이요 미련한 자의 등에는 막대기니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b06eb9c9759672201cdc95442f80883b24d285929ddc5293cb76e385be5f3f18",
      "translation_text_hash": "522671e7c3c638aa7e225057712a0f3b205317c9ab3a773bc744ff9b13dd67df",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
